(text "Test pads (PCB-T-02)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 24.13 138.43 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "55908530-96e9-5458-ab0d-08083d8d3979"))
(text_box "Notes\n1. Function: TPS2121 picks USB-C (IN1, priority above 4.4 V) or the HAT port (IN2) into VBUS_CHG.\n2. Absent state: both inputs absent: VBUS_CHG off, the charger unpowered.\n3. OV1 1.02 MΩ / 100 kΩ (11.1-12.6 V), OV2 464 kΩ / 100 kΩ (5.60-6.31 V), RILM 45.3 kΩ 0.1 %\n   (1.94-2.95 A); USB_SRC_ON and HAT5V_EN force OV1 and OV2 through a BAT54J each, so the T1's\n   own 5 V never re-enters the charger. PR1 31.6 kΩ / 10 kΩ (4.3-4.6 V), SS 100 nF, CP2 to\n   GND: capture choices (SLVSEA3F Eq. 5, Table 9-1, pin table).\n4. ST to a test pad instead of GND (SLVSEA3F §10.2.3): high when IN1 feeds the output, read\n   at bring-up with a pull-up on the probe." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 275.59 226.06 0) (size 129.54 22.86) (margins 1.905 1.905 1.905 1.905) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fca5357c-d8d8-5d5e-8241-0f98cdc608f8"))
(text "Interface" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 22.86 248.92 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "21ac75a1-3a2d-5739-a8a3-d0f847ed313f"))
